    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so in the ac circuit, since the current is \"flowing\" because of the constant charging and discharging, what actually determines how much it resists the current? like, if i change the capacitor size or the frequency, how does that impact the reactance specifically? can u walk me through an example?",
